{"id":"5288cdeab9eb11f7","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-order11-antitone-map.md","title":"ZFC Order11 Antitone Map","display":"df-zfc-order11-antitone-map — ZFC Order11 Antitone Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order11-antitone-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order11-antitone-map"],"display":"df-zfc-order11-antitone-map — ZFC Order11 Antitone Map","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order11-antitone-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order11-antitone-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order11-antitone-map — ZFC Order11 Antitone Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,P,Q,x,y\">\\(f,P,Q,x,y\\)</span> (order parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P,\\leq_Q\">\\(\\leq_P,\\leq_Q\\)</span> (orders on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q\">\\(P,Q\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-partial-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11AntitoneMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11AntitoneMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}antitone\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11AntitoneMap}_S(f,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(Q,\\leq_Q)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,P,Q)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in P\\;(x\\leq_P y\\to f(y)\\leq_Q f(x))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}antitone\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11AntitoneMap}_S(f,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(Q,\\leq_Q)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,P,Q)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in P\\;(x\\leq_P y\\to f(y)\\leq_Q f(x))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>定义显式区分定义域与值域上的两个序；仅给出定义域和值域集合不足以保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 是函数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","sta